{"page":51,"width":1810,"height":2490,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"문세는 다음과 같다. 고대 인도의 베나레스에는 세계의 중심이 있고. 그 곳에는 아주 큰 사원이","words":[{"text":"문세는","x":181,"y":217,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"다음과","x":281,"y":216,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"같다.","x":383,"y":216,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"고대","x":463,"y":216,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"인도의","x":535,"y":217,"width":83,"height":33},{"text":"베나레스에는","x":634,"y":216,"width":174,"height":34},{"text":"세계의","x":821,"y":216,"width":83,"height":34},{"text":"중심이","x":919,"y":214,"width":84,"height":36},{"text":"있고.","x":1021,"y":214,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"그","x":1101,"y":217,"width":29,"height":24},{"text":"곳에는","x":1142,"y":212,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"아주","x":1243,"y":212,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"큰","x":1314,"y":214,"width":29,"height":30},{"text":"사원이","x":1356,"y":211,"width":84,"height":34}]},{"text":"있다. 이 사원에는 높이 50m 정도 되는 다이아몬드 막대 3개가 있다. 그 중 한 막대에는 천지","words":[{"text":"있다.","x":182,"y":274,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"이","x":263,"y":273,"width":24,"height":34},{"text":"사원에는","x":304,"y":272,"width":116,"height":35},{"text":"높이","x":433,"y":273,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"50m","x":504,"y":276,"width":73,"height":28},{"text":"정도","x":592,"y":273,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"되는","x":663,"y":273,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"다이아몬드","x":734,"y":274,"width":144,"height":33},{"text":"막대","x":891,"y":272,"width":54,"height":34},{"text":"3개가","x":961,"y":271,"width":75,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":1050,"y":270,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"그","x":1130,"y":274,"width":29,"height":24},{"text":"중","x":1171,"y":270,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"한","x":1214,"y":270,"width":30,"height":33},{"text":"막대에는","x":1255,"y":268,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"천지","x":1386,"y":268,"width":53,"height":33}]},{"text":"창조 때에 신이 64장의 순금 원만을 그기가 큰 것으로부터 차례로 쌓아 놓았다. 신은 승려들에게","words":[{"text":"창조","x":183,"y":331,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"때에","x":250,"y":331,"width":5